  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Rural Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEDA-PY will work in collaboration with Pro Desarrollo Integral Rural (PRODIR), a microfinance institution, to organize 2,500 farmers and improve their production of manioc and sugar cane to market directly to two agro-processors and - exporters. The training, technical assistance and access to credit the farmers will receive will also extend to their goals diversifying their agricultural production for sale and consumption and developing their individual enterprises.</narrative>
  </description>
